00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:46.330
Leaving on track 5, Hall, Butica, Syracuse, Rochester, Buffalo, and Niagara Falls.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:47.070
Are you all right?

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:48.410
I'm fine.

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:54.440
You should have let me come up to meet you.

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:56.190
See me get out of prison.

00:01:57.120 --> 00:01:58.720
It's not a thing I want you to remember.

00:01:59.040 --> 00:01:59.840
You're home, love.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.780
Father, that's all that matters.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:07.740
