00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:07.400
It's from the contact department.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:08.320
They're from Mr. Colby.

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:12.290
Can you tell me where I...

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:13.010
Just a moment, please.

00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:18.750
Contract is from Mr. Colby.

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:20.770
Well, I can't disturb him right now.

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:26.780
How many doors and secretaries do you have to go through to get to see this guy?

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:29.970
Anything I...

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:36.160
can do for you any number of things but unfortunately i'm here on business i want to see mr colby what

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:40.780
did you want to see him about well he's been carrying on with my grandmother i'd like to find

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:44.460
out what his intentions are if you have any business with mr i have lots of business but it's

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:49.830
all personal i'm his secretary his personal secretary well it just goes to show you how far

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:53.090
a girl can get if she keeps her stocking seam straight don't get up thank you i'll announce

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:59.780
myself just a minute you can't go in there don't blame the girl mr colby whichever one you are

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:01.210
She did her best.

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:03.490
I trust this is something urgent.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:05.150
If you're Andrew Colby, it's very urgent.

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:05.990
