00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:07.390
Well, my name's Robert Regan.

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:07.970
I'm an attorney.

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:10.250
I'm representing a client named Emilio Canepa.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.560
As a result of your negligent driving,

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:17.360
