00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:21.410
You ignored my letters, so I brought you a little invitation

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:23.410
ordering you to appear in magistrate's court.

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:25.670
This in case you've never seen one as a summons.

00:04:25.810 --> 00:04:27.630
They're issued by the city of New York.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:28.730
Yes.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.120
I've heard of the procedure.

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:32.710
In that case, good day.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.830
Oh, just a minute, Mr. Egan.

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:37.110
Perhaps we can settle this matter out of court.

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:38.340
Forgive me, gentlemen.

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:41.910
