00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:53.980
Yes, I'm afraid she might.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:56.180
This is Mr. Porter and Mr. Griswold.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:04:58.500
How do you do?

00:04:58.580 --> 00:04:59.040
How do you do?

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:02.480
For your convenience, I've brought you an itemized account.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.780
Twenty-three dollars for the damage to the push cart.

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.250
Twelve dollars for the bananas.

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:10.990
