00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:48.050
How do things go?

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:51.090
Beautifully. Beautifully.

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:57.540
As a matter of fact, you can wire our Paris office that we'll be ready to leave in two weeks.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:01.180
I'm ready right now.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:01.780
