00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:07.540
You're getting tired of New York?

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:08.810
Not particularly.

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:13.180
It's just that, well, high finance isn't my idea,

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:14.880
the most stimulating thing in the world.

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:17.040
But the things you can do with the money.

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:21.100
You can buy steamships and oil wells and head waiters.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:25.520
Wouldn't you like an old stuffed major domo to use as a hat rack?

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:27.850
Come in, Charles.

00:07:27.970 --> 00:07:28.830
I've been waiting for you.

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:29.970
Krona got it.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:43.250
on the 1012 nobody met him but his daughter five years it doesn't seem possible how did he look

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:51.940
charles about the same thinner little bitter i suppose i should see him so i try to reach

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:59.070
him for you no no we'll wait for him to call us no

