That young attorney who was here, what did you think of him?

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:09.300
Well, I don't know. Brash, hot-headed, fairly bright, I imagine.

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:12.950
Have him come to see me tonight.

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:14.740
Come to see you?

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:19.000
Yes, nine o'clock, home.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:47.620
