00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:48.600
Regan.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:49.400
Rather than Regan.

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:18.180
Expecting someone this way. Mr. Regan. I take your things, please. Thank you. I had a place felt like you get lonesome. Good evening, Mr.

