I'm worth $40 million. I'm going to have a secretary

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:37.390
who looks exactly like you. Oh, my taste

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:40.120
is fairly simple. $20 million would be

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:43.610
quite enough. How's Amelia Knieper?

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:53.250
Check me a check. I feel like a man of distinction.

