01:00:13.340 --> 01:00:15.080
Why should Andrew want to kill Croner?

01:00:18.160 --> 01:00:20.580
Suppose Colby dreamed up this whole counterfeit deal himself.

01:00:22.500 --> 01:00:24.900
He promises Croner a share of the profits if he'll take the rat,

01:00:25.330 --> 01:00:27.330
